<title>SOUTH KOREA: BOXING-SOUTH KOREA'S CHOI RETAINS WBA JUNIOR-LIGHTWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-SOUTH KOREA'S CHOI RETAINS WBA JUNIOR-LIGHTWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Choi Yong-soo retained his World Boxing Association (WBA) junior- lightweight title when he outpointed Japanese challenger Koji Matsumoto on Saturday.</p>
<p>Choi retained his crown with a unanimous points verdict.</p>
